{"id": "EUVD-2026-103460", "enisaUuid": "78303490-21a6-31b4-b582-0406abcbe43a", "description": "Schism Tracker through 20260524 contains a heap out-of-bounds write vulnerability in fmt_ult_load_song() in fmt/ult.c that fails to clamp the one-byte sample count to MAX_SAMPLES. Attackers can supply a crafted .ult module that overwrites the instruments pointer array, causing csf_destroy() to free attacker-chosen pointers and crash the application.", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T11:38:30", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T16:38:41", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:L/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haindpwn/schismtracker-ult-sample-count-oob-write", "https://github.com/schismtracker/schismtracker/blob/74215ae300b555928332e03152dfcdc898f96ca6/fmt/ult.c#L319-L330", "https://github.com/schismtracker/schismtracker", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/schism-tracker-through-20260524-heap-out-of-bounds-write-via-ult-loader"], "aliases": ["GHSA-qfh4-g83h-4vcx", "CVE-2026-112007"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1eeb2982-38d5-3380-84f0-3f94cba547bb", "product": {"name": "Schism Tracker", "vendor": {"name": "schismtracker"}}, "product_version": "0 \u226420260524"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "240fb253-5b9b-33e0-be75-8e822860f70d", "vendor": {"name": "schismtracker"}}], "isExploited": false}